# Business Rules (from spec)

Refer to [especificacao-guild-points-rf-online.md](../../especificacao-guild-points-rf-online.md) for full detail.

## Auth & membership

- All registrations start **`PENDENTE`**; pending users see waiting screen only.
- **Discord OAuth:** race/class NOT set at signup — mandatory modal on first login; block app until `profile_complete`.
- Moderador+ approves/rejects; approved → `APROVADO`.

## Profile & points

- Nickname/class/race changes → public audit log (old + new values).
- Líder/Admin: add/remove points with mandatory reason; modalities `AJUSTE` | `LEILAO`.
- Manual event assignment to member also grants points.

## Objetivos & Eventos

- **`LIMITADO`:** max N redemptions per member per objective **per calendar day** (count `claimedAt` for member+objective+date).
- Event: 4-char password, fixed durations; WS toast on create; one claim per member per event; expires at duration end.
- Admin can **deny** a claim → auto-deduct points + log reversal.

## Leilões (summary)

- Bid ≤ total points; **availableBalance** = total − sum of winning bids in other open auctions.
- Tie bid only if bid equals member's max available (not if they can exceed).
- ≤15s left → extend to 25s; DOLE 1/2/3 bot sequence (+10s if bid during DOLE).
- End tie → roulette (≥10s spin); winner debited via `LEILAO` modality.

## Itens

- All types require image on create. Talic rules enforced backend — see `talic-validation` skill.
